rchived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-12T04:26:21Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T09:17:09Z","closed_at":"2026-04-13T09:16:41Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.dev\n\n### Issue description\n\n`AudioRBResampler::mix()` divides by `target_mix_rate` without validation:\n\n```cpp\nint32_t increment = (src_mix_rate * MIX_FRAC_LEN * playback_speed) / target_mix_rate;  // line 124\n```\n\nThe `setup()` method stores `target_mix_rate` directly with no validation:\n```cpp\nError AudioRBResampler::setup(int p_channels, int p_src_mix_rate, int p_target_mix_rate, ...) {\n    target_mix_rate = p_target_mix_rate;  // No check for 0\n```\n\nIf `p_target_mix_rate` is 0 (e.g., from an uninitialized or misconfigured audio driver), this causes a division by zero on the audio thread.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nTriggerable if audio driver initialization produces a zero mix rate (edge case with certain audio backends or misconfigured systems).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A — division by zero visible from source analysis.","closed_by":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/user